  "Software Details": "تفاصيل البرامج",
  "The Partial Payment Module in eCommerceGo SAAS enables you to provide your customers with the flexibility of paying for their purchases in manageable installments. This feature is particularly beneficial for high-ticket items, making your products more accessible to a broader audience. By offering installment plans, you not only enhance customer satisfaction but also increase your sales potential. This flexibility allows customers to make larger purchases without the immediate burden of paying the full amount upfront, fostering a more positive buying experience.": "تتيح لك وحدة الدفع الجزئي في eCommerceGo SAAS تزويد عملائك بمرونة الدفع مقابل مشترياتهم على أقساط يمكن التحكم فيها. ",
  "View Live Demo": "عرض تجريبي مباشر",
  "Control Over Deposits": "السيطرة على الودائع",
  "Customize the payment experience by enabling or disabling the force deposit button according to your business requirements. This feature allows you to decide whether an initial deposit is necessary for your customers to begin the installment plan. Having control over this setting ensures that you can adapt the payment process to suit different scenarios and customer preferences. This flexibility helps you maintain a balance between securing a commitment from the customer and providing a convenient payment option.": "قم بتخصيص تجربة الدفع عن طريق تمكين أو تعطيل زر الإيداع القسري وفقًا لمتطلبات عملك. ",
  "Comprehensive Payment History": "سجل الدفع الشامل",
  "The Partial Payment Module offers a comprehensive view of all partial payments made by your customers. You can effortlessly access detailed payment histories, including dates, amounts, and payment methods. This transparency helps you maintain accurate records, making it easier to manage finances and address any customer inquiries regarding their payment schedules. By having a clear and organized history of payments, you can ensure better financial management and customer service.": "توفر وحدة الدفع الجزئي نظرة شاملة لجميع الدفعات الجزئية التي قام بها عملاؤك. ",
  "Real-Time Payment Status": "حالة الدفع في الوقت الحقيقي",
